      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file named `embed_text.py` that generates an embedding vector for one text string using a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that offers text embedding capabilities. The code will import the necessary modules from the Bedrock SDK and use a specific model identifier to generate the embedding. </thinking>\n",
